ar.","Net dilution runs at 30.6% annually, transferring value from owners to stock-based comp, and insiders hold 81% of the shares, so management thinks like owners because it is one \u2014 the strongest alignment there is, and profit capture is only 0.3\u00d7 the fair share, suggesting no structural edge inside its industry."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (0.9) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"SGA costs surged 29% YoY \u2014 may reflect legal, restructuring, or operational issues","sev":"red","cat":"trend"},{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Carries a 100% premium to sector median EV/EBITDA","sev":"amber","cat":"valuation","magnitude":0.9972876977720375},{"text":"Above-average short interest at 7.0% of float","sev":"amber","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Gross margin trails most Healthcare peers \u2014 competitors appear to have the pricing hand","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Carries more leverage than most Healthcare peers \u2014 a smaller cushion for the inevitable bad year","sev":"amber","cat":"balance_sheet"},{"text":"Significant goodwill (46% of assets) from past acquisitions \u2014 a soft asset a conservative appraisal discounts to zero","sev":"amber","cat":"balance_sheet"},{"text":"Patent cliffs, drug-pricing reform, and reimbursement pressure \u2014 a single regulatory change can reset the pricing power that justifies the multiple.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"GLP-1 disruption across sub-sectors \u2014 weight-loss drugs are reshaping demand for orthopaedics, cardiovascular devices, and sleep-apnea treatments in ways not yet priced in.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Piotroski score 7/9 \u2014 financials improving across profitability, leverage and efficiency","Financial quality scores above most Healthcare peers